Package: bootbridge
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: dreamzz2nd <https://github.com/dreamzz2nd/BootBridge>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-tk, qemu-system-x86, ovmf, swtpm, freerdp2-x11 | freerdp3-x11
Recommends: spice-client-gtk, tigervnc-viewer
Homepage: https://github.com/dreamzz2nd/BootBridge
Description: Safe & Lightweight Physical Dual-Boot Windows VM Launcher
 BootBridge enables users to seamlessly run their physical dual-boot Windows
 installation directly inside their primary Linux desktop using native KVM
 hardware acceleration without rebooting their computer. Includes disk safety guard,
 offline registry modification, bidirectional shared clipboard, and remote desktop.
